le_status":""},"say:6:1910149006:1":{"text":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","source_cn":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910149007:1":{"text":"お姉ちゃん、実はね……","source_cn":"沫霖姐姐，是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EEB7A34BD81DB5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1910149008:1":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"no_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910149009:1":{"text":"なるほど。陸には、私たちとは違う習慣があるのね。","source_cn":"原来这是陆地的习惯，和海裔有很大差异呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FAC8881E723945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910149010:1":{"text":"分かったわ。明日ばあばに話しておくから、もう一度狩りに行きましょう。","source_cn":"我知道了，明天早上我和阿嬷说一声，我们再出去围猎一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA4996C461C73FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910149011:1":{"text":"うん！それじゃ、他に問題がないならもう行くね。二人も早く休んでね。","source_cn":"嗯！既然没什么事，那我们先告辞了，你们也早点休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA898DEE84CDA836","varia